    "slug": "cthonic-terror",
    "description": "<p>The user was a member of a particularly dominant species in the distant past - one that not only survived and thrived, but utterly dominated their environment. </p><p>While the user has Fossilized slotted, they gain +5% Base Effect Chance and +10% RES, they take -20% less damage from Attacks, and their Attacks have +1 CRIT and +30% EHR if they are super effective.</p><p>On hit, the user’s Attacks have a 15% chance to inflict @Affliction[fear 2], @Affliction[tormented 2], and @Affliction[suppressed 2].</p>",
